00:09:21.303 --> 00:09:26.368
<v Host>To evacuate to a safe place early and stay inside a sturdy building.

00:09:26.967 --> 00:09:36.423
<v Host>That's all for today. If you're in Okinawa, please stay safe indoors and follow the local warnings. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

